{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/winslow-igo-meydan","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1416,"crm_id":"7501","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Winslow","slug":"winslow-igo-meydan","display_address":"Meydan","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2028","developer":"IGO","price":null,"display_price":null,"lattitude":25.178810671047,"longitude":55.324590342619,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Winslow by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-igo/\">IGO</a> is a contemporary mixed-use residential development located in the prime Meydan Horizon community. The project features a mix of residential, office, and retail units. The tower offers spacious <strong>1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments</strong>, with layouts reaching up to 2,992 sq. ft., designed to provide clear views, open horizons, and composed modern interiors.</p><p>The building includes 62 offices across podium levels 1 to 4 and 8 retail spaces on the ground floor, creating an active yet balanced environment for residents. A curated selection of amenities, including a fully equipped gym, infinity pool, and landscaped terrace garden supports both active routines and relaxed living. The project is scheduled for handover in Q2 2028 and offers a structured 60/40 payment plan, providing investors with flexibility and long-term planning advantages.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Winslow_Meydan_Horizon_1_to_3_Bedroom_Apartments_8e54d003db.jpg","hash":"The_Winslow_Meydan_Horizon_1_to_3_Bedroom_Apartments_8e54d003db","name":"The Winslow Meydan Horizon | 1 to 3-Bedroom Apartments"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Winslow_Meydan_Ho